SUMMARY:PRS Database: rule starts for the North West (draft)
DESCRIPTION:PRS Database dates for the North West. Rule starts: 15 May 2027
 . Register by: 14 August 2027.\n\nThe start date is in the draft Private R
 ented Sector Database Regulations 2026. The register-by date comes from Go
 vernment guidance on the Housing Hub. We last checked both on 3 October 20
 26. The regulations were still draft then\, so the dates could change.\n\n
 Check before you rely on these dates.\nGuide: https://innovatedigi.github.
 io/landlord-tracker/guides/prs-database-north-west/\nOfficial page: https:
 //housinghub.campaign.gov.uk/renting-is-changing/get-ready-to-register/\n
